  "releaseNotes": "v6.0.0 - First stable release, aligned with the Halifax 6 line. .NET 11 support, CSV moved to CsvHelper 34, package dependency updates\n            v0.4.5 - Add Source Link and a symbol package (snupkg) for source-level debugging\n            v0.4.4 - Package dependency updates\n            v0.4.3 - Package dependency updates\n            v0.4.2 - Package dependency updates, pin Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git to patch transitive vulnerability\n            v0.4.1 - Ship XML documentation in the package, enrich API docs, dependency updates\n            v0.4.0 - Package dependency updates, pin System.Security.Cryptography.Xml to patch transitive vulnerability\n            v0.3.2 - Package dependency updates, NPOI license acceptance\n            v0.3.1 - Bug fixes, DateTime support, comprehensive tests\n            v0.3.0 - Nullable reference types, trace warnings for conversion failures\n            v0.2.x - .NET 10 support\n            v0.1.x - .NET 9 support\n            v0.x.x - Alpha release",
